{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_029_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0c33f7a726cb39a6bbaf40692c1fa0a3d36edb35e4cb3f3a551d319422ebb871",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb61dfd7ef89fe11505320c696443d6dc08f709394e2babb35a94f7edafbf707",
      "text": "以上就是明天拍摄的流程。\n详情在这份资料里……阿斯兰先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:532ab5144e633ab2d2a402d57a781ba0febf7e697275c99d7d9017391b13ec91",
      "text": "……啊、啊啊。吾已知晓！于此番试炼中，\n吾亦将作为暗之眷属展现压倒性的魔力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a751b4a324b917cf2e1c4cc539764e964a280fedd506ccfabcee7faaa4a9f049",
      "text": "您刚才好像在沉思什么。\n有不明白的地方，我可以再讲一遍哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f372697fedd23783d3d21ed910b0b2a37391e0e58f9241f1e42a5bb9ac2a04b5",
      "text": "否，主之计划天衣无缝。明日封印残影之事，\n断无问题。虽无问题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22994095793391d0004a20785103652283ea04afcce50657b763a15d498305f3",
      "text": "吾主。恕吾转变话题，\n吾是否做了何事，触怒了同胞们？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b713a7bfff253a21fc414886884acf06c659e1a434ce917f7d6acae5c7b6e689",
      "text": "对Cafe Parade的大家吗？\n这是怎么回事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2278cbf7bcaed2f6d646a4fe0d051ffec6161f440cf9fe42e8e72a7ec4eab453",
      "text": "似是近来，同胞团皆在避开吾，\n召开极秘之圆桌会议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b5cee318cec7cf275f0bc56285cc9b1e5628c371fd95ee24171bf4761f91eb3",
      "text": "原来如此……那完全不用担心哦。\n我想很快就会真相大白的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bf8d5d8437b7d6cd495039f1eb0d3c98a58d199509cdb9acd58e87a577e8472",
      "text": "是如此么……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f95534edcbef2a51124240ee4db32696693a469a6b4be9b4a4d7dea836d201f4",
      "text": "吾知晓了。既然主如此断言，\n眼下便遵从该神谕吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
